		{
			description: [
				"This series contains multiple smaller modules. "
				""
				"\"Expansion\"  - contains the \"industrial base\" of the Series, providing options for energy generation, storage, and resource processing!"
				""
				"\"Foundation\" - contains common components, resources, and tools."
				""
				"\"Cultivation\"  - a collection of farming and food related things to make your world more agrarian and delicious!"
				""
				"\"Dynamics\"    - contains ducts which allow for transport of Energy and Fluids across distances great and small, as well as additional logistical blocks related to transport."
				""
				"\"Innovation\"  - a collection of things which increase player-centric power - useful tools, gadgets, and armor."
				""
				"\"Locomotion\" - the \"railyard\" of the Thermal Series - Rails and Minecarts to expand rail-centric gameplay."
			]
